#: assets/maps/story/20.tmx:
msgid "I advise you to take another path.\nThese monsters are too strong."
msgstr "Ich rate Dir, einen anderen Weg zu nehmen.\nDiese Monster sind zu stark."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Xeonjia Tower"
msgstr "Xeonjia Turm"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Hi Milla, are you ok? Did you get here without any problems?"
msgstr "Hi Milla, bist du in Ordnung? Hast du problemlos hergefunden?"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Hii {{hero}}!"
msgstr "Hii {{hero}}!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Yes, I cleverly managed to avoid the monsters that were along the way!"
msgstr "Ja, ich habe auf meinem Weg hierher geschickt die Monster vermieden!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I love those cute little green worms!"
msgstr "Ich liebe diese süßen kleinen grünen Würmchen!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "…S-such weird tastes here."
msgstr "…So ausgefallene Geschmäcker hier."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Unkind!"
msgstr "Scheußlich!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Aaanyway, look here! This is the tower where the King of Evil resides!"
msgstr "Wie auch immer, schau her! Das ist der Turm, in dem der König des Bösen haust!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Oh really? Are we there yet?"
msgstr "Echt? Sind wir schon da?"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "It seems so… but it's closed!\nThis nice gentleman here explained to me that to access the tower you need to have 3 signets."
msgstr "Es scheint so...aber sie ist verschlossen!\nDer nette Mann hier erklärte mir, dass man 3 Siegel braucht, um den Turm zu betreten."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Signets?"
msgstr "Siegel?"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I did not understand exactly what they are, but if I have not misunderstood they are kept in crypts present in each region of the Kingdom."
msgstr "Ich habe nicht genau verstanden, worum es sich dabei handelt. Aber wenn ich mich nicht irre, werden sie in Krypten in jeder Region des Königreichs aufbewahrt."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Mm… Then I really think that I have to set out in search of these crypts…"
msgstr "Hm... Ich glaube, ich muss wirklich nach diesen Krypten suchen…"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I guess you have no other choice."
msgstr "Ich fürchte Du hast keine andere Wahl."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr "Viel Glück!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Do your best!"
msgstr "Gib Dein Bestes!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I hate this little girl here… She pestered me with a thousand questions and she cried until I told her what she wanted. How impertinent."
msgstr "Ich hasse dieses kleine Mädchen... Sie hat mich mit tausend Fragen gelöchert und geweint, bis ich ihr gesagt habe, was sie wollte. Was für eine Unverschämtheit."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "One signet is not enough."
msgstr "Ein Siegel reicht nicht aus."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "\" Xeonjia Tower – Dwelling of the King of Evil. Stay away \""
msgstr "\" Xeonjia Turm – Wohnsitz des König des Bösen. Halte Dich fern \""

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "This door is closed."
msgstr "Diese Tür ist verschlossen."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "This door is closed, I need the 3 signets to open it."
msgstr "Diese Tür ist verschlossen. Ich brauche 3 Siegel, um sie zu öffnen."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I should go to the tower."
msgstr "Ich sollte zum Turm gehen."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "The tower is so ugly."
msgstr "Dieser Turm ist so hässlich."

#: assets/maps/story/16.tmx:
msgid "Why am I here? What am I supposed to do?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37_house.tmx:
msgid "I love studying history and literature."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37_house.tmx:
msgid "\"[…] but half of the army defected, made a deal with the King of Evil and founded the Hoarfrost Team. That moment decreed our defeat.\"\nThis book tells what happened 64 years ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Zuhause"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Good morning mom!"
msgstr "Guten Morgen Mama!"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Hi {{hero}}! Did you sleep well?"
msgstr "Hi {{hero}}! Gut geschlafen?"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "mom"
msgstr "Mama"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Actually not very well… I'm still a little sleepy."
msgstr "Ehrlich gesagt nicht so gut...Ich bin immer noch etwas verschlafen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "You always are.\nAnyway, now it is time to leave, be very careful and remember to check your health in the top left bar."
msgstr "Wie immer.\nWie dem auch sei, jetzt ist es Zeit zu gehen. Sei sehr vorsichtig und vergiss nicht, deine Gesundheit in der Leiste oben links zu überprüfen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Yea mom. Don't worry, I'll be careful."
msgstr "Jaja Mama, keine Sorge. Ich werde vorsichtig sein."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "When you hit the rocks you could hurt yourself, so stop by our neighbor who have prepared a brand new pair of shin guards for you."
msgstr "Wenn du auf die Felsen triffst, könntest du dich verletzen. Schau also bei unserem Nachbarn vorbei, der ein brandneues Paar Schienbeinschoner für dich vorbereitet hat."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Sure, I will."
msgstr "Klar, werde ich."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Go get the shin guards from the neighbor, you will need them."
msgstr "Los, hol die Schienbeinschoner vom Nachbarn. Du wirst sie brauchen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "The new shin guards are beautiful, they match the suit."
msgstr "Die neuen Schienbeinschoner sind schön, sie passen gut zum Anzug."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "This plant hasn't been watered for long."
msgstr "Diese Pflanze wurde ewig nicht mehr gegossen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Unfortunately, this is not the time to lie down on the sofa."
msgstr "Leider ist jetzt nicht der richtige Zeitpunkt, um auf dem Sofa zu liegen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "This plant seems to have been recently watered."
msgstr "Diese Pflanze scheint kürzlich gegossen worden zu sein."

#: assets/maps/story/4_house.tmx:
msgid "The last time I went through the forest I was attacked.\nI'm not going back there anymore."
msgstr "Das letzte Mal, als ich durch den Wald ging, wurde ich angegriffen.\nIch werde dort nicht mehr hingehen."

#: assets/maps/story/4_house.tmx:
msgid "If you want to enter the forest you have to be careful, my grandson risked getting hurt there."
msgstr "Wenn Du in Wald möchtest solltest du vorsichtig sein. Mein Enkelsohn wurde dort fast verletzt."

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "Do you think piglets will one day be a common pet?"
msgstr "Glaubst Du, dass Ferkel eines Tages ein normales Haustier sein werden?"

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "I think so too."
msgstr "Das glaube ich auch."

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "Oh, I hope you are not right."
msgstr "Oh, ich hoffe Du irrst Dich."

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "I like piglets."
msgstr "Ich mag Ferkel."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_03.tmx:
msgid "Mossy Crypt -3F"
msgstr "Moosbewachsene Krypta -3.UG"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_03.tmx:
msgid "My work is so boring…"
msgstr "Meine Arbeit ist so öde…"

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Route 5"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Ok, you were better than me.\nI still have room for improvement, I will continue to train."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Anyway, it was great seeing you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "It was good to see you too, I felt like I was going back to when we were kids."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Hehe, you are right… we spent a lot of hours playing and training as kids.\nI'll leave you now, see you in the Xeonjia Tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Are you going to the tower too?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Yes, of course!\nI will go there and I will defeat the King of Evil!\nEven though you are the protagonist and the so-called \"Hero\" it will be me who will defeat the King of Evil and be remembered as the savior of the world hehe."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Wait, wait, wait, don't steal my job! Haha"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Anyway, be careful not to get hurt, bye!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I lost my glasses. I hardly see anything."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Are these your glasses?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Yes! Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "As a reward I give you this gem that I found while I was looking for the glasses."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Oh, thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I missed being able to see the sea."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I can't believe it took you this long!\nLet's fight!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I will defeat you."
msgstr "Ich werde Dich besiegen."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I have to train harder."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "This is a very strange stone… Never seen anything like this before."
msgstr "Das ist ein sehr eigenartiger Stein...So etwas habe ich noch nie zuvor gesehen."

#: assets/maps/story/11.tmx:
msgid "Hi, I'm an employee of the Kingdom.\nIf you get lost or have problems finding the way, come back to me and I'll help you."
msgstr "Hallo, ich bin ein Beamter des Königreichs.\nWenn du dich verirrst oder Probleme hast, den Weg zu finden, komm zu mir und ich werde dir helfen."

#: assets/maps/story/11.tmx:
msgid "Are you stuck?\nTake the path behind the blue tree."
msgstr "Kommst Du nicht weiter?\nNimm den Pfad hinter dem blauen Baum."

#: assets/maps/story/3_house1.tmx:
msgid "A few meters from here is the Mitsu Forest. Once it attracted many tourists as it was considered a sacred place, but now it's dangerous and infested with monsters."
msgstr "Nur wenige Meter von hier entfernt befindet sich der Mitsu Wald. Früher zog er viele Touristen an, da er als heiliger Ort galt, aber jetzt ist er gefährlich und von Monstern befallen."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Hoarfrost Team members came to our house because they wanted a gem that I found on the ground.\nWe managed to keep it hidden from them but we don't want to have problems anymore.\nWe don't even need it after all, can we give it to you?"
msgstr "Einige Mitglieder von Team Raureif kamen zu unserem Haus, weil sie einen Edelstein haben wollten, den ich auf dem Boden gefunden hatte.\nWir konnten ihn vor denen verbergen, aber wir wollen keinen weiteren Ärger.\nWir brauchen ihn auch gar nicht. Können wir ihn Dir geben?"

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Here's to you!"
msgstr "Auf Dein Wohl!"

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "Danke!"

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Oh, ok. Then I'll have to think about what to do with this gem."
msgstr "Ach ja, richtig. Dann muss ich mir überlegen, was ich mit diesem Schmuckstück anfangen soll."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Protect that gem well."
msgstr "Schütze dieses Schmuckstück gut."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Be careful when dealing with the Hoarfrost Team."
msgstr "Sei vorsichtig, wenn du auf Team Raureif triffst."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Mind your own business."
msgstr "Kümmer Dich um deinen eigenen Kram."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "This plant is very fragrant."
msgstr "Diese Pflanze duftet gut."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "This vase is very heavy, I can't move it."
msgstr "Diese Vase ist sehr schwer. Ich kann sie nicht bewegen."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Yes thanks"
msgstr "Ja danke"

#: assets/maps/story/43_tower_1.tmx:
msgid "Observation Tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "NEIGHBOR'S HOUSE"
msgstr "NACHBARHAUS"

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "Hello lad, are you all right? I made you the shin guards, you will need them to cushion the blows with the stones.\nI made them by hand. Here's to you!"
msgstr "Hallo Kumpel, wie geht es Dir? Ich habe Dir diese Schienbeinschoner gemacht. Du wirst sie brauchen, um den Aufprall auf die Steine zu dämpfen.\nIch habe sie selbst handgefertigt. Hier, bitte sehr!"

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "neighbor"
msgstr "Nachbar"

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "* {{hero}} got and put on the shin guards *"
msgstr "* {{hero}} hat Schienbeinschoner erhalten und angelegt *"

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "This way you will hurt yourself less, but be careful that they do not fully protect you from damage."
msgstr "Dadurch wirst Du Dich weniger verletzen. Aber sei vorsichtig, sie schützen nicht vollständig vor Schäden."

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "Thank you very much!"
msgstr "Vielen Dank!"

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "Since the shin guards I gave you do not fully protect you, try to think diligently about the moves you make."
msgstr "Da die Schienbeinschoner, die ich dir gegeben habe, dich nicht vollständig schützen, solltest du dir deine Bewegungen gut überlegen."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "I'm sorry but this road is closed.\nWork is underway to restore the railway system."
msgstr "Es tut mir leid, aber diese Straße ist gesperrt.\nZurzeit wird das Schienensystem wieder aufgebaut."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "Welcome to the City Hall."
msgstr "Willkommen im Rathaus."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "I can't wait till they finish to restore the railway system, it no longer work since the ice arrival."
msgstr "Ich kann es kaum erwarten, dass sie die Restaurierung der Eisenbahn beenden, die seit dem Eiseinbruch nicht mehr funktioniert."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "My wife remained blocked on the other side of the kingdom, I wonder if I will ever see her again."
msgstr "Meine Frau sitzt auf der anderen Seite des Königreichs fest und ich frage mich, ob ich sie jemals wiedersehen werde."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "\" City Hall ↑ \""
msgstr "\" Rathaus ↑ \""

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "\" Route 4 → \""
msgstr "\" Route 4 → \""

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "Before continuing I'd like to visit the City Hall."
msgstr "Ich möchte vorher noch das Rathaus besuchen."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "The City Hall seems spacious."
msgstr "Das Rathaus scheint geräumig zu sein."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "You're lucky, but it doesn't end here, guaranteed."
msgstr "Du hattest Glück, aber es ist noch nicht vorbei."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "You will not escape me."
msgstr "Du wirst mir nicht entkommen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I can't escape. I have to take the first signet."
msgstr "Ich komme nicht mehr raus. Ich muss das erste Siegel bekommen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Here it is, this is the first signet!"
msgstr "Da ist es, das erste Siegel!"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I can get out of here now."
msgstr "Endlich kann ich hier raus."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "The henchmen are after me! I'll get the signet later."
msgstr "Die Schergen sind hinter mir her! Ich werde das Siegel später holen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I didn't think you would get this far, kid."
msgstr "Ich hätte nicht gedacht, dass du so weit kommst, Kindchen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "W-Who are you? Who are you guys?"
msgstr "W-Wer seid Du? Wer seid ihr Typen?"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I'm surprised that my name is not known among the woods of your village."
msgstr "Ich bin überrascht, dass mein Name in den Wäldern deines Dorfes nicht bekannt ist."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Anyway, I'm Dr. Lache and I'm the leader of the Hoarfrost Team."
msgstr "Wie auch immer, ich bin Dr. Lache und der Leiter von Team Raureif."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "dr. lache"
msgstr "Dr. Lache"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "S-So you're the one who spread terror and violence through the henchmen as ordered by the King of Evil?"
msgstr "S-Sie sind also derjenige, der auf Geheiß des Königs des Bösen mit seinen Schergen Terror verbreitet?"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "As ordered by the King of Evil? HAHAHA"
msgstr "Auf Befehl des Königs des Bösen? HAHAHA"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I don't take orders from anyone. Between me and the King of Evil there is a peer collaboration."
msgstr "Ich nehme keine Befehle von irgendjemandem an. Zwischen mir und dem König des Bösen besteht eine gewisse Zusammenarbeit."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Be that as it may, I won't let you continue your plans."
msgstr "Auf jeden Fall werde ich nicht erlauben, dass Sie mit Ihren Plänen weitermachen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I'm {{hero}}, I'm the chos-"
msgstr "Ich bin {{hero}}, ich bin der Auserwä-"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I know very well who you are, you're the chosen hero and blah, blah, blah.\nI don't have time for this."
msgstr "Ich weiß genau, wer Du bist, Du bist der auserwählte Held und blah, blah, blah.\nIch habe keine Zeit für so etwas."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I know you're interested in the signet, defeat my henchmen and it's yours.\nNow get out of my way."
msgstr "Ich weiß, dass Du an dem Siegel interessiert bist. Besiege meine Gefolgsleute und es gehört dir.\nUnd jetzt geh mir aus dem Weg."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I won't let you go so eas-"
msgstr "So einfach lasse ich Dich nicht davonko-"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Well, well, well… you'll have to deal with us now."
msgstr "Sieh an, sieh an, sieh an...jetzt wirst Du Dich mit uns rumschlagen müssen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I'm Iosa."
msgstr "Ich bin Iosa."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "And I'm Joza."
msgstr "Und ich bin Joza."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "We are the Iosa&Joza brothers and we will be your worst nightmare."
msgstr "Wir sind die Gebrüder Iosa & Joza und dein schlimmster Albtraum."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I'm not scared of you, let's see what you are capable of!"
msgstr "Ich habe keine Angst vor euch. Los, zeigt was ihr könnt!"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Now you will see."
msgstr "Du wirst gleich sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Let's fight!"
msgstr "Kämpfen wir!"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "iosa&joza"
msgstr "Iosa & Joza"

